<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n82311" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">περι-σύρω</span></b>  [<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">υ</span>],
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>drag about</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄνω καὶ κάτω</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Luc.
					<u>Merc.Cond.</u>
					30
				</span></i>
			 (
				Pass.
			) ; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">περισῠρέντα τὴν πόλιν</span>
			<i>dragged round</i> the city, <i><span class="en">
				J.
				<u>BJ</u>
				2.12.7
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> metaph.,
				<i>satirize, ridicule</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Eust.
				1816.46
			</span></i> (
				Act.
			 and 
				Pass.
			). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>tear off, pick off</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ χλωρόν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					LXX
					<u>Ge.</u>
					30.37
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>tear away, take by violence from</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὴν λείαν τινῶν -σῠρεῖν</span> (fut.
			inf.) <i><span class="en">
				Plb.
				3.93.1
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				4.19.4
			</span></i> :—
				Med.
			, <i>carry off</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λείαν περιεσύραντο</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hyp.
					<u>Fr.</u>
					264
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				App.
				<u>Hisp.</u>
				65
			</span></i> : metaph., <i>destroy</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ph.
				1.178
			</span></i> : —<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">περισύρεται</span> is 
				f.l. for
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">παρασύρεται</span>
			 in <i><span class="en">
				D.P.
				864
			</span></i>.</div>
